  "records": {
    "description": "A device with item handling, cart loading, and box input/output features.",
    "features": [
      "11 x 14 x 4wt",
      "0gt between carts; items within an item type are pulled at 8x HS",
      "Splits HermitCraft8 items at 6.3x HS (57000 I/H)",
      "Random input proof",
      "Water stream empty box input",
      "Water stream unstackable and split box output",
      "26 hoppers (2 locked)",
      "No idle carts",
      "Empty box proof"
    ],
    "considerations": [
      "Empty box collection will lose about 1/1500 boxes",
      "Buffers an empty box"
    ],
    "notes": "Slice locks for a duration after all boxes are processed to allow the idless-cart loader to power down; it remains unlocked until all boxes are cleared. The threshold for the next cart to check for the same type is 19. The first cart of each type pulls 27; every cart after pulls 28. There are 10–38 gt between item types, depending on final stack size."
  },
